#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now...on the other side of this camera, the\n"
"mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Ngay cả lúc này... ở phía bên kia của chiếc camera này, kẻ\n"
"chủ mưu...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>でも、それももうすぐ終わりだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's gonna come to an end soon enough!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Nhưng chuyện đó sẽ sớm kết thúc thôi!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>もう…ここには何も入ってない…
#. 空のダンボール箱だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's absolutely nothing in here. It's just a\n"
"normal, empty cardboard box.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このデッキで…
#. ＤＶＤが再生出来るはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This should be able to play DVDs just fine...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よし、さっそく確認してみよう。
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well then, I'd better take a look..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんから受け取ったＤＶＤを、
#. デッキへと差し込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took the DVD Kyoko gave me and put it in the player.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>再生が始まっても、
#. すぐには映像は流れなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It said that it was playing, but nothing appeared on\n"
"screen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>暗いままの画面をしばらく見つめた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I stared into the black of the monitor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ほんの数秒…だったと思う。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must have only been a few seconds...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、その時間が、
#. ボクにはとても長く感じられた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...but to me it felt like an eternity.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、極めて唐突に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then, all of a sudden...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“その映像”は始まった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...an image appeared.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ま、舞園さん…！？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sayaka!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで不意打ちだった…
#. そこには、久しぶりに見る舞園さんの姿があった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It took me by total surprise. I hadn't seen Sayaka in\n"
"who knows how long, and there she was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. では面談を始めようか…
msgctxt "0016 | NO NAME"
msgid "Okay then, are you ready to begin?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>画面手前に座った男の声が聞こえた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The voice I heard was of the man positioned on one\n"
"side of the screen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大人の…男性の声…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was the voice of a middle-aged man.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 悪いが、この面談の様子は録画させてもらうよ。
msgctxt "0019 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"I do apologize, but I hope you don't mind if I record\n"
"our conversation."
msgstr ""

#. 私は不器用なんでね…
msgctxt "0020 | NO NAME"
msgid "I'm a little slow, you know."
msgstr ""

#. 喋りながら面談の内容を書き留めるなんて、
#. 器用な事が出来ないんだよ。
msgctxt "0021 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"I never really got the hang of taking notes while\n"
"having a conversation."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>男にとっては冗談のつもりらしかったが、
#. 舞園さんの強張った顔は１ミリさえも動かなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It sounded like he was trying to make a joke, but\n"
"Sayaka's tense face didn't move a single millimeter.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この映像は、
#. ある意味、契約書代わりだが…
msgctxt "0023 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"So, this video is meant to serve as a kind of contract\n"
"substitute."
msgstr ""

#. 君らを信用してない訳じゃない。
#. ただの保険だ。だから気にしないでくれ。
msgctxt "0024 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"It's not that I don't trust you guys. It's more\n"
"like...insurance. So please don't worry too much."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0025 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. では、さっそく本題に入らせてもらうよ…
msgctxt "0026 | NO NAME"
msgid "Now then, let me get straight to the point."
msgstr ""

#. 君は、これからの一生を、
#. この学園の中だけで過ごす事になるかもしれない。
msgctxt "0027 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"There is a chance that you may have to spend the rest\n"
"of your life here in the school."
msgstr ""

#. …それを了承してくれるか？
msgctxt "0028 | NO NAME"
msgid "Can you accept that?"
msgstr ""

#. りょ、了承するも何も…
msgctxt "0029 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Y-You want me to accept that...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの顔は、明らかに困惑していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka was obviously at a total loss.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>当たり前だ。学園内で一生過ごせなんて…
#. そんな事を受け入れられる訳が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It made total sense. Who would agree to spending the\n"
"rest of your life in this school?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. わかりました…
msgctxt "0032 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I...accept."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…え？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...What?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …そうか、すまんな。
msgctxt "0034 | NO NAME"
msgid "Thank you. And I'm sorry about all this..."
msgstr ""

#. それなら、私も全力で君を保護する事を約束しよう。
msgctxt "0035 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"Well, I can promise you that I will do everything in\n"
"my power to keep you safe."
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園学園長の…名にかけてだ…
msgctxt "0036 | NO NAME"
msgid ""
"As the headmaster of Hope's Peak Academy, I give you\n"
"my word."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで、映像は終わった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As if on cue, that's where the video cut out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>今までもそうだったけど…
#. でも、これは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was a lot I hadn't understood up till now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これだけは、本当に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But this...only this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …意味がわからない。
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I simply couldn't comprehend what I'd heard."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、舞園さんは、
#. ここから出たかったからこそ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because I know how much Sayaka wanted to get out of\n"
"here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出て、大切な仲間達と一緒に、
#. 夢に挑戦したかったかったからこそ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I know how much she wanted to escape and pursue her\n"
"dreams with her friends again.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ボクを…陥れようとしたはずだ。
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She wanted that so bad...she tried to frame me for\n"
"murder."
msgstr ""

#. それなのに…どうして…？
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...why?"
msgstr ""

#. どうして…この学園での一生を受け入れるなんて…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Why would she say yes to living here for the rest of\n"
"her life?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、その時だった。
#. 不意に、ボクの視界が光を捉えた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As I sat there thinking about it, I noticed a\n"
"sudden light.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モニターでは、終わったと思っていた映像が
#. もう１度再生を始めていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the monitor, the video that I thought was finished\n"
"flashed back onscreen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なかば反射的に、
#. モニターへと視線を戻すと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My eyes darted back to the screen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで、ボクは見た。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And if I was confused before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、さらなる混乱に見舞われた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...what I saw next pushed me right over the edge.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. <CLT 4>そこに映っていたのは、ボクだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What I saw was...me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紛れもなく、ボク自身だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Impossibly, undeniably, me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、面談を始める前に言っておくが、
#. この面談の様子は録画させてもらうよ。
msgctxt "0055 | HEADMASTER"
msgid ""
"So, Makoto. Before we begin, I should let you know\n"
"that I'll be recording our conversation."
msgstr ""

#. はい…
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "Có..."

#. <CLT 4>学園長と面と向かうボク…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Me and the headmaster were looking at each other.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長と会話を交わすボク…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He and I were having what seemed like a fairly normal\n"
"conversation.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、それを見ている今のボクには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I, the I in the here and now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな記憶は一切ない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...had absolutely no memory of it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな面談はおろか、学園長と会った記憶さえない。
#. それなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I had no memory of even meeting the headmaster, much\n"
"less sitting down to talk to him like this.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …では、さっそく本題に入ろうか。
msgctxt "0062 | HEADMASTER"
msgid "Now, shall we get straight to the point?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、君はこれからの一生を、
#. この学園内だけで過ごす事になるかもしれない。
msgctxt "0063 | HEADMASTER"
msgid ""
"Makoto... There's a chance you may have to spend the\n"
"rest of your life here in the school."
msgstr ""

#. …それを了承してくれるか？
msgctxt "0064 | HEADMASTER"
msgid "Can you accept that?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. はい…
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "Có..."

#. <CLT 4>ウソ…だろ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This can't be real...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>はい…って言ったのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...said yes?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …すまんな、こんな思いをさせて。
msgctxt "0069 | HEADMASTER"
msgid "I'm sorry I'm putting you through all this."
msgstr ""

#. だって…仕方ないですから…
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, I mean...we don't have much of a choice, do we?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、君がこの学園にいる限りは、
#. 私が全力で守ってみせる。
msgctxt "0071 | HEADMASTER"
msgid ""
"But I promise that as long as you're in this school, I\n"
"will do everything I can to protect you."
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園の学園長として、
#. それだけは約束しよう…
msgctxt "0072 | HEADMASTER"
msgid ""
"As the headmaster of Hope's Peak Academy, that's the\n"
"very least I can do for you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>再び、映像は途切れた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once again, the video cut out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後も、映像は
#. 中断と再生を何度も何度も繰り返した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From there, the video repeated the same scene again\n"
"and again with the others.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クン…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、そのみんなが…
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 4>Everyone..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この閉鎖された学園での一生を
#. 受け入れるような発言をしていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They all said that they agreed to live in this\n"
"school...forever.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さらには……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Và rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>霧切さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の面談の様子も、
#. しっかりと録画されていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her interview with him had been recorded just as\n"
"clearly.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女は、やっぱり会ってたんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without a doubt, she *had* met him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望ヶ峰学園の学園長と…
#. 自分の父親と……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She'd sat down with the headmaster of Hope's Peak\n"
"Academy—her father...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、彼女も学園長の問いかけに対して、
#. 他のみんなと同じように答えていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And when he asked her his question, she answered the\n"
"same as everyone else.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここでの一生を受け入れる、と…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She accepted a life within the school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、霧切さんの面談が終わりそうになった、
#. その時だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just as Kyoko's interview was wrapping up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>唐突にかつ不自然に、
#. モニターの電源が切れた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the monitor suddenly went black.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モニターだけじゃない。
#. デッキの電源もまとめて切れ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It wasn't just the monitor. The DVD player itself had\n"
"apparently turned off.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もちろん、ＤＶＤは再生をやめた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which of course meant that the DVD wasn't playing\n"
"anymore.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだ…どうして…？
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What the heck just happened...?"
msgstr ""

#. おっとっと…どうやら故障してしまったようですね。
msgctxt "0093 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Oopsie! Looks like it broke! Out of service!"
msgstr ""

#. は…？　故障…？
#. こんなタイミングで？
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? It just so happened to break just now...?"
msgstr ""

#. どんなタイミングであろうと、
#. 故障は突然やって来るものなのです。
msgctxt "0095 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now, then, when, doesn't matter! Failure can strike\n"
"anywhere, anytime!"
msgstr ""

#. なぜなら、それが故障だから！
msgctxt "0096 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "That's what failure IS, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. 何が故障だよ…
#. わざとジャマしたに決まってる…！
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Failure my ass! You cut the power on purpose!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、どうせ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, whatever...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 最後まで見ても一緒だ…
#. 今みたいな映像が続くだけなんだ…
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Even if I watched the whole thing, it'd just be more\n"
"of the same..."
msgstr ""

#. 他のみんなも同じように質問され…
#. 同じように答えるだけ…
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He'd ask them the question, and they'd all say yes..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは思わず大きなため息を吐き出した。
#. と同時に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't help myself. I let out a huge, exasperated\n"
"sigh. But as I did...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>脳裏に、ある言葉が浮かんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I remembered something.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そして、あそこで気を失って、
#. 目覚めた直後だったわ。
msgctxt "0103 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I fainted, too. And when *I* woke up..."
msgstr ""

#. 自分の中の…妙な違和感に気付いたのは……
msgctxt "0104 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...I noticed a strange feeling of...separation within\n"
"myself. A disconnect."
msgstr ""

#. 今思えば、あの時すでに、
#. 私の記憶は失われていたのよ…
msgctxt "0105 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Thinking back on it now, at that point my memory was\n"
"gone."
msgstr ""

#. あの時…私は忘れてしまったの…
msgctxt "0106 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "At that time...I'd forgotten."
msgstr ""

#. この学園に来た大事な目的の事も…
#. 自分の“超高校級”と呼ばれる能力の事も…
msgctxt "0107 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I couldn't remember why I'd come to this school, and I\n"
"couldn't remember what my \"ultimate\" ability was."
msgstr ""

#. でも、忘れたなんて…
#. どうして、そんな事が…？
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...what would make you forget all that?"
msgstr ""

#. 不思議でしょ？　とても偶然とは思えないわよね？
#. こんな、ご都合主義で塗り固められた展開…
msgctxt "0109 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Strange, isn't it? It's hard to imagine it happened by\n"
"chance. It seems much too convenient."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ご都合主義的展開…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A convenient outcome...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕にとってのご都合主義で、
#. 塗り固められた展開…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something that seemed to obviously work in favor of\n"
"the mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、この状況も…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So does that mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ボクも…忘れてる？
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...I've lost my memory, too?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、他のみんなは？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What about the others?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他のみんなも忘れてるのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Have we *all* forgotten?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それとも……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>緊急面談のＤＶＤ<CLT><CLT 23>を更新しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0118 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Interview DVD<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been updated in the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0119 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Bíng bong, bing bong”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 物事には、始まりがあれば、
#. 必ず終わりがあるのです。
msgctxt "0120 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "For anything that has a start, there has to be an end."
msgstr ""

#. そして、終わりがあれば、
#. 新しい始まりもあるのです。
msgctxt "0121 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And if the end comes, then that means it's time for a\n"
"fresh start."
msgstr ""

#. 明けない夜はないよ…
msgctxt "0122 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "There is no night that doesn't have a dawn..."
msgstr ""

#. 真っ暗な朝だけどね！
msgctxt "0123 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Although that dawn is totally pitch-black!"
msgstr ""

#. 止まない雨はないよ…
msgctxt "0124 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "There is no storm that won't eventually end..."
msgstr ""

#. 干ばつ状態になるけどね！
msgctxt "0125 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Of course, then that leads to drought!"
msgstr ""

#. そう、終わりがあるから、
#. 新しい始まりもあるのです。
msgctxt "0126 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But as I said, every end is the promise of a new\n"
"beginning."
msgstr ""

#. だから、また会えるよね。
#. だって、終わりこそが始まりだから…
msgctxt "0127 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Which is why I'm sure we'll get to meet again. Because\n"
"the end is only the beginning!"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、始めましょうか！
msgctxt "0128 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Anyway, let's get started!"
msgstr ""

#. 終わりの学級裁判の始まりだよ！
msgctxt "0129 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "The beginning of the end of the class trial!"
msgstr ""

#. いつもの場所で、また会いましょう！
msgctxt "0130 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Everyone gather once again at you know where!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷぷ！！
msgctxt "0131 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhuhuhu! Puhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>始まる…始まってしまう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's about to begin again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学級裁判が…始まる……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The class trial...is going to start.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最後の学級裁判が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The final class trial...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらの命を賭けた学級裁判が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The last time all our lives will be on the line...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望と絶望を賭けた…最後の学級裁判が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The last time hope and despair are on the line...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やるしかない…よな。
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't have a choice. I have to do this..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>行こう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Okay, then!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これが…最後だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0139 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the end...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…とにかく、ＤＶＤを見てみよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0140 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check out the DVD...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
